* German Ultra preamp, stage 5 of 5: the relay that picks the channel, V5a, V5b (the effects loop in bypass) and the master. Driven by stage 3's node odo (VODO) and stage 4's node cw (VCW).

V VRAIL x 100 470
R R33 x nA 10k
C K22 nA 0 30u
R Rdummy_nA nA 0 55.5k
S VODO odo 1 0
S VCW cw 1 0
R SW_RB_NC odo vx 1
R SW_RB_NO cw vx 1e12
R R102 vx 0 1M
C C101 vx g6 100n
T V5A g6 p6 k7 12AX7
R R103 g6 cb 1M
R R104 k7 cb 470
R R100 cb 0 22k
R R201 nA p6 22k
C C100 p6 f1 1u
R R101 f1 0 100k
R R108 f1 v5g 180k
C C133 f1 v5g 47p
R R109 v5g 0 51k
T V5B v5g p7 k8 12AX7
R R106 nA p7 100k
R R110 k8 0 1.8k
C C102 p7 d3 100n
R R145 d3 y 180k
R VR13 y 0 1
